5,0,1,talk,Jonathan,,Let us begin this ordeal with a calm mind. I hope we can find the wolf quickly.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Mizuki,,Agreed. Logic and observation will be our best tools here.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Rin,,This is like a real mystery game! I'm going to find the bad guy!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Misaki,,I'll do my best to help.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Benjamin,,A delightful challenge. I look forward to seeing how our collective reasoning unfolds.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Jonathan,,"Does anyone have any initial theories, or is it too early?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Mizuki,,It is far too early for theories. We have no data yet.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Rin,,Maybe the wolf is someone who is acting too quiet!,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Misaki,,"That could be anyone here, Rin.","{""words"":6,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Benjamin,,"A classic observation, though perhaps a bit premature, wouldn't you say?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Jonathan,,I suppose we should just observe each other's behavior for now.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Mizuki,,Exactly. Let's see who tries to lead and who tries to hide.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Rin,,I'm not hiding! I'm right here!,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
