31,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"I have information. Mizuki, you are the werewolf.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,That is a bold lie. I am a villager. You are likely the wolf trying to frame me.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Rin,,"What?! Already? Jonathan, are you sure?","{""words"":6,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Misaki,,This is a very direct start.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"My, what a dramatic opening. Jonathan, you've certainly chosen the most efficient path to a conclusion.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,I am the Seer. I saw the truth last night.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"A common claim for a werewolf. If we execute me and I'm innocent, we lose a valuable asset.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Rin,,"But if Jonathan is the Seer, we can win right now!","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Misaki,,It's a risk. But the Seer's claim is very specific.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,Indeed. The question is whether we trust Jonathan's sudden clarity or Mizuki's composed denial.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I have no reason to lie. The village should act now.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,I urge you to think logically. Why would the Seer reveal themselves so instantly? It's too risky.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Rin,,Maybe he just wants to save us quickly!,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Misaki,,I'm leaning toward believing Jonathan.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"I find Mizuki's defense quite standard, yet Jonathan's confidence is compelling.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
